-DATASET CSV empty
--

-CASE SBMCliquesP3
-LOAD_DYNAMIC_EXTENSION algo
-STATEMENT CALL generate_stochastic_blockmodel(blocks:=[2,2], P:=[[1.0,0.0],[0.0,1.0]], seed:=1) RETURN node1, node2, weight
---- 2
0|1|1.000000
2|3|1.000000

-CASE SBMCountP3
-LOAD_DYNAMIC_EXTENSION algo
-STATEMENT CALL generate_stochastic_blockmodel(blocks:=[3,3], P:=[[1.0,0.0],[0.0,1.0]], seed:=9) RETURN count(*)
---- 1
6

-CASE SBMErrorP3
-LOAD_DYNAMIC_EXTENSION algo
-STATEMENT CALL generate_stochastic_blockmodel(blocks:=[2,2], P:=[[1.0]], seed:=1) RETURN node1
---- error
Binder exception: generate_stochastic_blockmodel requires len(blocks) == len(P).
